<title>UK: TABLE-Witan interim net asset value rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Witan interim net asset value rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year to June 30</p>
<p>    Shr (pence)			4.26	  vs 4.08</p>
<p>    Div (pence)			3.05	  vs 3.05</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (pence)  354.0	 vs 308.1</p>
<p>    Net asset total return	 13.5 pct    vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			    20.15	 vs 19.55</p>
<p>    Attributable		     15.98	 vs 15.31</p>
<p>NOTE - Witan Investment Co is an investment trust.</p>
<p>The dividend was paid on July 1</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
